OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after woman in her
OL,4,A70s dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of a woman.
OL,9,FHertfordshire Police was called to
OL,10,FArmour Rise in Hitchin at 15:15 BST
OL,11,Ffollowing a report of concern for
OL,12,Fwelfare.
OL,14,FA woman in her 70s was pronounced dead
OL,15,Fat the scene.
OL,17,FThe 59-year-old man remains in custody
OL,18,Fand police believe he and the woman
OL,19,Fwere known to each other.
